c8f8c5c]\n\n### System information\n\nAll platforms\n\n### Issue description\n\nCtrl-clicking symbols in the code editor now only opens the auto generated documentation for a class instead of navigating to the symbol's script file.\n\nNot sure if this is a regression or a new feature but it makes navigating code near impossible.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create two script files, foo.gd and bar.gd\n2. Write some code where bar.gd calls a function on foo.gd.\n3. While editing bar.gd, click a symbol from foo.gd\n\nExpected:\nThe script editor jumps to foo.gd at the location of the symbol clicked.\n\nActual:\nThe auto generated docs for foo.gd are opened.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18386472/new-game-project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101436/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes